Subject: [PATCH] computercontrol: validate parcelled session parameters at the
 service boundary

Enforce v5 notification content, target count and attribution constraints independently of client-side builders. Add crafted-Parcel regression cases and update supported-version test fixtures.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
